<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>FRP 内网穿透管理 · 映射列表</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-primary: #0a0e14;
      --bg-secondary: #141b22;
      --bg-card: #1a2129;
      --border: #26303d;
      --text-primary: #e2e6eb;
      --text-secondary: #8b949e;
      --text-muted: #5c6670;
      --accent: #d29922;
      --accent-dim: rgba(210,153,34,0.1);
      --danger: #e5534b;
      --success: #3fb950;
      --radius: 8px;
      --font-mono: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', 'Menlo', monospace;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg-primary);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Navbar */
    .navbar {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      background: var(--bg-secondary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0 24px; height: 56px; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
    }
    .navbar-brand {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    .navbar-dot {
      width: 7px; height: 7px; background: var(--success); border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(63,185,80,0.5); animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.4} }
    .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
    .nav-btn {
      padding: 7px 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);
      background: none; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;
      font-family: inherit; transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .nav-btn:hover { color: var(--text-primary); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
    .nav-btn.logout:hover { color: var(--danger); }

    /* Page header */
    .page-header {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 24px 10px;
    }
    .page-header h1 {
      font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .page-header .sub {
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .sub .count { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }

    /* Table */
    .table-wrap {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 40px;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;
      background: var(--bg-secondary); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    thead { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
    th {
      text-align: left; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-secondary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    td {
      padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(38,48,61,0.5);
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    tbody tr:hover { background: rgba(210,153,34,0.04); }

    .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; }
    .addr { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: #79c0ff; font-size: 12px; }
    .port { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--accent); }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .badge.online { background: rgba(63,185,80,0.12); color: var(--success); }
    .note-cell { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; font-family: var(--font-mono); max-width: 200px; }
    .note-cell.creds { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 600; }

    /* Warn banner */
    .warn-banner {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 8px;
    }
    .warn-banner-inner {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: rgba(210,153,34,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(210,153,34,0.15);
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent);
    }

    .footer {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 40px;
      font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .navbar { padding: 0 12px; }
      .page-header, .table-wrap { padding-left: 12px; padding-right: 12px; }
      td, th { padding: 10px 8px; font-size: 11px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="navbar">
    <span class="navbar-brand">
      <span class="navbar-dot"></span>
      FRP 内网穿透管理
    </span>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <button class="nav-btn" onclick="location.reload()">刷新列表</button>
      <button class="nav-btn logout" onclick="location.href='/'">退出</button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>内网映射配置</h1>
    <p class="sub">当前活跃映射 <span class="count"><%= mappings.length %></span> 条 · frp-manager v1.8.2</p>
  </div>

  <div class="warn-banner">
    <div class="warn-banner-inner">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z"/>
        <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/>
      </svg>
      <span>部分映射条目包含敏感凭据信息，建议配置 RBAC 权限控制后移除明文显示。</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>#</th>
          <th>服务名称</th>
          <th>内网地址</th>
          <th>内网端口</th>
          <th>映射端口</th>
          <th>协议</th>
          <th>状态</th>
          <th>备注</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% mappings.forEach(function(m) { %>
        <tr>
          <td class="mono"><%= m.id %></td>
          <td><%= m.name %></td>
          <td class="addr"><%= m.localAddress %></td>
          <td class="port"><%= m.localPort %></td>
          <td class="port"><%= m.remotePort %></td>
          <td class="mono"><%= m.protocol %></td>
          <td><span class="badge online"><%= m.status %></span></td>
          <td class="note-cell<%= (m.note && m.note.includes('/')) ? ' creds' : '' %>">
            <%= m.note || '—' %>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <% }) %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">FRP 内网穿透管理 v1.8.2 · 仅供授权运维使用 · <%= new Date().getFullYear() %></div>

</body>
</html>
